      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' aníng iri ki/ís dír afkuduú tsee/a, kuduú bihhaá da/aáw, guruú tsee/a didá' hhoohhooe, nee afkudá' kwa tseék. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng iri báy, «Afkusíng mukuwa baloó gweér. Hee tumu wák miwa diisíng ar dáh, asma anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, ana dáh ar afkusíng. Gawaá adoorihe mukuwa baloó gweér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe, geeraharusmo kilós amoodá' keemuuwo gan aleesláy nee muruú /aymaadá' hhohhó' guri /aay geeraaeé' wa alé. Inós aqo in dah iri ti'iit ar afkuduú kilá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng iri huúw dír geeraá Doó Mungú ar loohír bihhaá /iya. Niwa qaytsiít xirfuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ una ár, Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gwaa hatsiís. Aníng niri tumbarara'aát, giti ngiri yaamúr óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng iri báy, «Aá heewí, muruuwí ta ara'aan, nee ta axamis, kángw kilá' wa harmagahheek baraá muunaáwoge. Dabér Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngi oó', ló'wa iiárií qaaseek, a muu gaalá oo dáh nee oo ti'iít baraá Doó Mungú, nee a muu gaalá oo dahamaawo ta ya/a/anká?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Mukuú Israeli aa dee/anuut kaangwí ti beer, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Muruudá' sleémeero kuungá' ta tlehhita' aníng saqitluuwo u aleeslawaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dír hotaeé' aga meetagasé', as múk taa hhehhe'eesiiká iwa didií daráh, múk aníng i ilaiwawa/aaká, qoomár di/i nee tseere birki dir'eénií hanmiis. Gawaá adoorihe, muk'eé', kuungá' alqador'eé' aga geexeeré', ar muruuhúng kudá' aníng ni ahhiit kuungá' taa tlehhité'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitángw geera kuungá' gadiyér'eé' tidá' hhohho' kawa tlehha', múk xoordaá hatlá' gadiyeédá' gana tleéhh didár hotaaeé' wa ale.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, hee tumu wák oo ta pa/ángw dahmá i haniisi i kaahh tam oo xooro gaalá, oo taa hheehhe'eesiiká slaqwto laqaá muunahe, laqaá oo aníng i ilaiwawa/aaká, oo taa ya/aámár dahmií haniisi i kaahh ar didá' hhoohhoo', tam hoomaadá' ayaahúng hoot sleeme.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala múk Laáwi aníng iga geexáy, qoomár múk Israeli tiwa paraátl dir'eene as munguaá hatlá' ngiwa eehariyé', aníng múk Laáwi u muúx. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín gadiyeé ngin tleehhiyá' didár hotaaeé' wa alé, adór sagadiyuusér afér maraá dooeé' xuum, nee tawa gadiyuusi baraá dooeé' wa ale, nee hikwaadá' muu naa ilahhooár da/tá wa huwahuúw nee awa ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i as ngiwa tsu/iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inooín múk Israeli nguwa geerahariyé' firór munguaá hatlae, nee muu nguri tlakweemár ayé', aníng dakw'eé' ugwa gáwtí tleés as ngiwa muux. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. Inooín muxtar'ín ngi slayá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín i male i tseewuy'aaká as iwa sagadiyusiya' adór kaahamuuse, laqaá xooslar'eé' tidá' hhohho' ngi malé kwatimitiaaká, laqaá tidá' ak ló'wa hhohho'. Ala inooín ki mureekees nee tlehhmi'ii'ín kudá' slasla/aren naa tlehhiitiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe inooín baalaqasidár xuumár dooeé' ngi oohiyá', nee gadiyeé sleémeero ar ta didá' wa tleehhi, inooín sleeme ngi tleehhiyá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala kaahamuusér Mungú ar tlahhoó Laáwi, kudaá xwaylár Sadoki, kudá' gadiyeé nga alkone' dir'eé' tidá' hhoohhooe, qoomár múk Israeli aníng iwa geexáy, kuká' an kudá' aníng i sagadiyusá' nee geeraaeé' hardáh as di/i nee tseere ngiwa haniisiya'. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' kilooín an kudá' dahá' didár hotaaeé', inooín nin tseewuyá' dír kitangwduú ilahhooa as iwa sagadiyuusiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes ta darah baraá afeenidár guruú baraá do', tlabaá hhohho' awa neewór kitaáni ki tsiit, ala tlabaá se'éngw bee/aangw mikiwa tsiít qoomár bir gadiyusiyá' dír afeenidár guruú do' nee baraá do'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Warqamaá neewór kitaáni ngi tsegitiyá' gawaá sager'ín, nee surwaánaay ngun dahaasiyá', ala hima ku tseegiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár inooín birna ti'itiyé' amór afeenír tsee/a amór muu, tlabaaín kudá' naa dahaasiyé' qoomár tawa gadiyuusi, ki duuxi nee kiri baats baraá kutuwaydá' hhohhó'. Tlabaadá' aqo ngin warqeesiyá' nee awa hatlá' aqo ngi dahaasiyá' as muu mukuwa hhoohhooeés ar tlabaaín kudá', qoomár birti kwatimitiyá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Sager'ín ngi baloó deqwiaaká, laqaá se'engw'ín ngu tlenaángwí may'aaká, ala se'engw'ín aqo ngu tawo /aaresiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú difaái mingiwa wáh, qoomár bir dah dír afeenidár baraá guruú do'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú /ameenír kwaalo'o mingiwa duúx, laqaá tam /ameenír taa talaákaárí haniís, ala inós masók aqo dasír nee hhawaata naa baloó alqati'iiká ar múk Israeli, laqaá /ameenír hhawaatuuwós kaahamusmoó Mungú, hhawaatuuwós kuú kaahamusmo bira gwaá' ngi duuxi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
